# FRQ_SEQ  1.4   Format version 2023.06.03
#
#  Frequency sequence used by Haystack in 2017-2021
#
#  Astronomical convention is used for band definition
#  For instance notation 2004.1 32.0 means the band
#  that covers range [2004.1, 2036.1] MHz
#
#  Last updated by L. Petrov on 2026.01.21_22:11:06
#
MOD_NAME  m03
HDS_NAME  h1
#
STATION KOKEE12M  K2  udc_01
STATION GGAO12M   Gs  udc_01
STATION MACGO12M  Mg  udc_01
#
#  Bnd Low_frq bandwidh
#
BAND A  4112.4  32.0     Inv
BAND A  4144.4  32.0     Inv
BAND A  4176.4  32.0     Inv
BAND A  4208.4  32.0     Inv
BAND A  4368.4  32.0     Inv
BAND A  4400.4  32.0     Inv
BAND A  4432.4  32.0     Inv
BAND A  4464.4  32.0     Inv
